default57. alloc_hugepages and
free_hugepages 58, bdflush 59,
create_module 60, nfsservctl 61,
perfctr 62, get_kernel_syms 63, and
setup 64 are not present on modern Linux.
clock_adjtime, clock_settime 65, and
adjtime 66 depend on CAP_SYS_TIME.
pciconfig_read and pciconfig_write 67 and all of the
